-- A loan belongs to a late member when the member it names is called "late". The condition
-- reaches the member through the loan's own `member` field.
--
-- `velle compare` from an empty spec (an empty file) to this file prints, under "What that
-- changes", these lines among others:
--
--   ### Loan
--   - A new Member can now make a Loan become a LoanOfLateMember.
--   - A new Member can now make a Loan stop being a LoanOfLateMember.
--
-- Neither can happen. An existing loan already names its member, and a new member is named by
-- no existing loan. Only a new loan, or a rule setting a loan's member, can move a loan into or
-- out of LoanOfLateMember.
act Member { name: text }

act Loan {
    member: one Member
    title: text
}

shape LoanOfLateMember = Loan where member.name == "late"
